# Review routing for the catalog.
#
# The 17 azuresql-db-* container skills are THIS repository's content. Carlos
# Robles made the catalog their parent on 2026-09-20: they are authored,
# optimised, evaluated and tested here, and microsoft/azure-sql-database-container
# receives copies, a copy that is on hold until he says go. Until that day the
# ownership ran the other way and an edit here was called forking the product,
# which is what the rule at the foot of this file used to be about.
#
# Add Iqra and Yo-Lei once they have write access.

*                                       @croblesm

# The manifest and the schema. Every generated surface is built from these.
/catalog/                               @croblesm

# The gates.
/scripts/                               @croblesm
/.github/workflows/                     @croblesm

# The prefill contract the feedback skill fills by field id.
/.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/                @croblesm

# The container family, authored here since 2026-09-20. The reviewer is named
# because these ship to a product in private preview, not because the files
# belong to another repository.
#
# THE PATH WAS WRONG AND MATCHED NOTHING. It said
# /skills/azure-sql-database-container/, a directory that stopped existing when
# the layout went flat under D12 and the domain moved into the sidecar. The rule
# had been routing no review at all for some time. skills/ is flat, so the family
# is named by its prefix.
/skills/azuresql-db-*/                  @croblesm
